			"note": "'I am sorry'; ይቅርታ (yih-kir-tah) works too."},
		"yes": {"native": "አዎ",
			"respelling": "ah-woh", "status": "ai"},
		"no": {"native": "አይደለም",
			"respelling": "ai-deh-lem", "status": "ai",
			"note": "A quick አይ (ai) is the everyday short no."},
		"amazing": {"native": "አስደናቂ!",
			"respelling": "ahs-deh-nah-kee", "status": "ai",
			"note": "ቂ is that same sharp, popped k."},
		"delicious": {"native": "በጣም ጣፋጭ!",
			"respelling": "beh-tahm tah-fahch", "status": "ai",
			"note": "'Very tasty'; ጣ and ጭ are both sharp, popped sounds."},
		"cheers": {"native": "ለጤናችን!",
			"respelling": "leh-teh-nah-chin", "status": "ai",
